Self learning bot that is not a bot
We have created a bot that can solve capchas on its own.
Here we have example of how it's solving capcha.

It works by taking screenshot of 
our cloudflare hosted website of capchas. 
Which is passed to cloudflare worker with gema 4
that gives it back where on the screen should it tap.
It repeate the proccess after each click by the arm on the screen.
until It solve the capcha. AI worker can also check which pictures are 
selected and if incoret one is selected it will send command to be deselected.
But how did we get it from coordinate to robot clicking on the screen

Generaly when robots are trained you have to repeat the same task at least 50 tinmes
which can be used on training the model. 
We took different selflearning aproach. 

The only imput we do is help the robot find 9 areas on the screen. 
Than we start it's self learnig journey. We have circles which it should touch
it has mutliple atempts to touch tham. After each unsusssfull atempt it knows how to improve.

Longer this trainig the better it gets. 

Our current aproach can work on any  2d space. The only thing it need is to recieve
coordinates of the screen. And the best part if anything changes 
it can teach it self with minimal human intervention.

This can be improved where we would teach the robot in 3d space. We had system of cameras
that knew where it is and we can reward it.

We created a bot which can do anytyhin on a screen.
And with bit of finetuning we can do anything on any 2d plain.
